{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026DfwnDZLgIC1793000725.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>薔琵已減弱為溫帶氣旋，為日本九州等地帶來暴雨。</p><p></p><p>九州的大分縣早上持續落大雨。長崎的平戶及五島48小時降雨量高達300毫米。在北九州的小倉，道路被浸，有汽車「死火」。</p><p></p><p>氣象廳表示，減弱後的薔琵向東北方向移動，預計周一晚推進至四國以南，四國未來24小時雨量可達200毫米。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.JP.TYPHOON-1500_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026aFtSIMejzM1793000778.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>而受暖濕氣流影響，大氣狀態持續不穩定。九州北部會有高達5米大浪，並伴有湧浪。氣象廳提醒相關地區慎防地質災害、低窪積水及河流水位上漲。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T09:00:52.389735+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":201,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T05:02:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T17:18:52.130040+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T08:58:13.178527+00:00","content_hash":"8fe07b4aeae5a4b195d0cddea9f2886b4c20279678cac204d2e33acc8a1a5d25","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T09:00:52.389735+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}